---
title: CI pipeline
---
flowchart LR
    push([Push to a branch]) --> lint[fmt and clippy]
    lint --> test[Tests]
    test --> cov{Coverage at least 98%?}
    cov -->|yes| pr[Ready to merge]
    cov -->|no| fail[[Fail the run]]
    lint -. warnings .-> fail

    subgraph release [Release, on main]
        direction TB
        decide{New version?} -->|yes| build[Build binaries]
        build --> publish[(crates.io)]
        decide -->|no| skip(Nothing to do)
    end

    pr ==> decide
